1
00:03:54,193 --> 00:04:00,193
The future belongs to the mad.

2
00:07:48,387 --> 00:07:54,387
Mad Max: Fury Road is a action, adventure, science
fiction film directed by George Miller.

3
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:48,580
An apocalyptic story set in the furthest reaches of our planet, in a stark desert landscape where
humanity is broken, and most everyone is crazed fighting for the necessities of life.

4
00:15:36,774 --> 00:15:42,774
Within this world exist two rebels on the run who
just might be able to restore order.

5
00:19:30,967 --> 00:19:36,967
Max Rockatansky, played by Tom Hardy.

6
00:23:25,161 --> 00:23:31,161
Imperator Furiosa, played by Charlize Theron.

7
00:27:19,354 --> 00:27:25,354
Nux, played by Nicholas Hoult.

8
00:31:13,548 --> 00:31:19,548
Immortan Joe, played by Hugh Keays-Byrne.

9
00:35:07,741 --> 00:35:13,741
Slit, played by Josh Helman.

10
00:39:01,935 --> 00:39:07,935
Rictus Erectus, played by Nathan Jones.

11
00:42:56,129 --> 00:43:02,129
Mad Max: Fury Road is a 2015 Australian post-apocalyptic action film co-written, co-produced and directed by
George Miller, who collaborated with Brendan McCarthy and Nico Lathouris on the screenplay.

12
00:46:50,322 --> 00:46:56,322
The fourth instalment in the Mad Max franchise, it was produced by Village Roadshow Pictures and Kennedy
Miller Mitchell, and distributed by Roadshow Entertainment in Australia and by Warner Bros.

13
00:50:44,516 --> 00:50:50,516
Pictures internationally.

14
00:54:38,709 --> 00:54:44,709
The film stars Tom Hardy and Charlize Theron, with Nicholas Hoult, Hugh Keays-Byrne, Rosie
Huntington-Whiteley, Riley Keough, Zoë Kravitz, Abbey Lee, and Courtney Eaton.

15
00:58:32,903 --> 00:58:38,903
Set in a post-apocalyptic desert wasteland where petrol and water are scarce commodities, it follows Max Rockatansky (Hardy), who joins
forces with Imperator Furiosa (Theron) against warlord Immortan Joe (Keays-Byrne) and his army, leading to a lengthy road battle.

16
01:02:27,096 --> 01:02:33,096
Miller came up with the idea for Mad Max: Fury Road in 1987, but the film spent
many years in development hell before pre-production began in 1998.

17
01:06:21,290 --> 01:06:27,290
Attempts to shoot the film in the 2000s were delayed numerous times due to the September 11 attacks, the Iraq War, and
controversies surrounding star Mel Gibson, leading Miller to recast Gibson's role of Max Rockatansky.

18
01:10:15,483 --> 01:10:21,483
Miller decided to pursue the film again in 2007 after the
release of his animated comedy film Happy Feet.

19
01:14:09,677 --> 01:14:15,677
In 2009, Miller announced that filming would begin in early 2011.

20
01:18:03,870 --> 01:18:09,870
Hardy was cast as Max in June 2010, with
production planned to begin that November.

21
01:21:58,064 --> 01:22:04,064
Principal photography was delayed several more times
before it actually began in July 2012.

22
01:25:52,258 --> 01:25:58,258
The film wrapped in December 2012, although
additional footage was shot in November 2013.

23
01:29:46,451 --> 01:29:52,451
Mad Max: Fury Road premiered in Los Angeles on 7 May 2015,
and was released in Australia on 14 May.

24
01:33:40,645 --> 01:33:46,645
The film grossed $380.4 million at the worldwide box office,
making it the highest-grossing Mad Max film.

25
01:37:34,838 --> 01:37:40,838
It was nominated for ten awards at the 88th Academy Awards, winning six awards, and received numerous other accolades, including Best Film from the National Board of Review,
eight AACTA Awards from twelve nominations including Best Film and Best Direction and was also named one of the top ten films of 2015 by the American Film Institute.

26
01:41:29,032 --> 01:41:35,032
It has also been called one of the greatest action films of all time.

27
01:45:23,225 --> 01:45:29,225
A prequel comic book series was published by Vertigo from May to August 2015.

28
01:49:17,419 --> 01:49:23,419
A prequel film, Furiosa: A Mad Max Saga, was released on 24 May
2024, with Miller returning as writer and director.

29
01:53:11,612 --> 01:53:17,612
The film explores themes of rescue, future, australia, chase, dystopia.

30
01:57:05,806 --> 01:57:11,806
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
